  <diagram id="oa01-domain-classes" name="Operational analysis: all seven entities" alt="Seven entity classes share id, version, createdAt and updatedAt. Analysis targets Subject and owns Assertion, QueryRun and Assessment. QueryRun acquires Evidence. Assessment pins Assertion versions and cites Evidence versions. Review records a decision on an exact Assessment. Evidence, Assessment and Review are immutable at version 1." kind="class" entities="Subject,Analysis,Assertion,QueryRun,Evidence,Assessment,Review" relationshipIds="0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7">
